 cards:[['CASE 1980-02 · Did Dharmendra convert to Islam?','<b>Established:</b> married Prakash in 1954, four children, never divorced; married Hema around 1979–80. <b>Alleged:</b> both converted and took a nikah as Dilawar Khan and Ayesha Bi. <b>The receipt:</b> a purported nikahnama put before a court in 2004. <b>The problem:</b> it never names Dharmendra and was never verified. <b>Both</b> denied it. <b>Verdict: DISPUTED.</b> Not a confirmed conversion, not a baseless internet rumor either.','a'],
  ['Before Hema there was Prakash','Married in 1954 at 19, six years before his first film. She belongs to the before-Bollywood chapter. By the time Hema arrived he was a married father of four.','t'],
  ['The set became the shaadi','Tum Haseen Main Jawan, Sharafat, Seeta Aur Geeta, Jugnu, Dost, Sholay. The professional network built the personal one, which is the thesis of this whole site.','t'],
  ['"Any man would have preferred Hema"','Prakash in 1981: not an ideal husband, an excellent father. She defended him; she did not declare war. So there\'s no feud thread between the two wives.','t'],
  ['Esha met Prakash at 30','The first meeting came in 2011, per Hema\'s biography. That one fact says more about how separately the two houses ran than any gossip column.','t'],
  ['Estranged or just private?','<b>Internet:</b> two families who don\'t speak. <b>Family:</b> rakhi, a Gadar 2 screening, "no negativity at all". We show both and code them as half-siblings, no estrangement thread.','a'],
  ['Every child opens a door','Sunny → Darr → SRK and Yash Chopra. Bobby → Animal → Ranbir. Esha → Dhoom and Yuva → the Bachchans, No Entry → Salman. Abhay → ZNMD → Hrithik, Katrina, Farhan. Madhoo → Roja → Mani Ratnam, who later directed Esha in Yuva.','t'],
  ['Three acting generations','Dharmendra → Sunny, Bobby, Esha, Abhay → Karan (Pal Pal Dil Ke Paas, directed by his father) and Rajveer (Dono).','t']],
